From: Braving Authors <support@braving.org>
Date: Fri, 5 Sep 2026 10:25:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [policies] Enforce debloat policies and Brave Origin backend

This patch enforces radical debloat enterprise policies in C++, enables the
Brave Origin backend features without paywall, and pre-seeds direct uBlock
Origin & EasyList list subscriptions.
---

